## Commands

Project tasks run through npm scripts. No global tools are required.

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `npm install` | Install the pinned project tooling (`<%= tooling.package %>@<%= tooling.version %>`). |
| `npm run project:info` | Validate `krf.project.json` and show the project's settings and versions. |

Commit `package-lock.json` after `npm install`.
